DATA LICENSE NOTICE

The fitted model objects (*.rda files) distributed with this application
were derived from the SETAC DRAW (Drift Risk Assessment Workshop) database.
The DRAW database is a collaborative dataset assembled from spray drift
trials conducted by research institutions across the EU and North America
under the SETAC DRAW workshop program.

The model objects and associated reference data are provided for research
and regulatory risk assessment purposes. Use of the underlying data is
subject to the terms agreed by the SETAC DRAW workshop participants.

For details, see: https://www.spraydriftmitigation.info/
